{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"747915178187817123","content":"**Gregarious Gauntlets:**\nThis stall is run by a large bugbear man who talks in extremely dramatic fashion. Many of his pieces of armor are fancy and catching to the eye. He ages his whole lifespan over the course of a day, his taste and required gifts changing with him. The interior of the stall, which is an open-air blacksmithy with a small room in the back for sleeping, has several clocks strewn about. As the day progresses, the bugbear man will go by different variants of the same name: JJ, Jimmy, John, James, and Johnathan.","created_at":"2020-10-10T04:20:31.740000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"764341572821057566","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"747915178187817123","content":"**Items Available:**\nBarkskin Armor: Your Armor Class can't be lower than 16 while you wear this armor. It smells of sweet maple.\nStoneskin Armor: You have resistance to non-magical bludgeoning, piercing, and slashng damage while you wear this armor. It smells of rock candy.\nCoward's boots: When you take the *disengage* action on your turn, your walking speed increases by 10 feet until the end of your turn.\nStable breastplate: The first time each day you are reduced to 0 hit points but not killed outright, this armor immediately stabilizies you at 1 hp, though you are not conscious.\nCirclet of the suave: this circlet gives you advantage on saving throws against being charmed or put to sleep\nViscous armor: when an enemy rolls a natural 1 to hit you with a melee attack, they must succeed on a DC 15 Strength saving throw or have their weapon stick to you. The weapon can be removed by using an action to make a successful DC 15 Strength check. If you were hit with an appendage, the creature is grappled by you instead of being disarmed.\nShatterheart Breastplate: While wearing this breastplate, if you would be killed due to a blow/attack, instead the armor takes the hit for you and is destroyed, infusing you with enough life essence to be conscious at 1HP, albeit without armor.\nTwo-faced Helmet: While wearing this helmet, you gain a bonus to your initiative rolls equal to your wisdom modifier (minimum of 1) and cannot be surprised unless you are blinded.","created_at":"2020-10-10T04:20:38.691000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"764341601975271434","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
